    "description": "<p>When another creature is threatened by an <strong>attack</strong>, <strong>spell</strong> or other <strong>danger</strong>, you may take their place (any Checks that are part of the danger will be performed against you; you may declare the use of this Skill <strong>before or after</strong> the Checks have been made). If the danger already affected you, it affects you <strong>twice</strong> (resolve both instances separately). You cannot protect multiple creatures from the same danger. If you use this Skill during a conflict, you cannot use it again until the start of your next turn.</p><hr><p><em>You can use this effect to track if you have this Skill available to use during a conflict.<br></em><strong>You Gain:</strong> @EFFECT[Compendium.projectfu.skills.Item.biHrtuJc1M3Xo7S4]</p>",
